  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>In the directories</head>
        <p>Eliza Terrace is a row of houses in <ref target="civic?id=Barry%20Street">Barry Street</ref>, at the <ref target="civic?id=Grattan%20Street">Grattan Street</ref> end. It is listed as its own street in the directories from 1869 to 1885, from the Eliza Terrace corner to the corner of Barry and Grattan streets. From 1871 the houses are numbered 1 to 4, and in some years a further house is listed without a number. Eliza Terrace is also listed as a corner in the Barry Street listings from 1869 to 1885 and in 1905.</p>
      </div>
